### 查询全部图书
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books

### 新增一本图书
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Spring 实战",
  "author": "赵六"
}

### 再次查询全部图书，确认新增结果
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books

### 修改编号为 1 的图书
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Spring Boot 进阶",
  "author": "张三"
}

### 查询编号为 1 的图书，确认修改结果
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
